

SQL> -- TO_BINARY_FLOAT minimal A-compatibility design verification.
SQL> -- The function performs one binary32 quantization and returns OG_TYPE_REAL.
SQL> -- Direct value output is diagnostic only; PASS equality checks are used for
SQL> -- Oracle comparison because ogsql and SQL*Plus use different default widths.
SQL> alter system set use_bison_parser = true scope = memory;

Succeed.

SQL> 
SQL> set pagesize 200


SQL> set linesize 240


